  "title": "Paolo D Probable NDE 5452",
  "date": "+- 1989",
  "content": "As a consequence of a car accident, I suffered brain trauma and I have been in coma for some days. It was in that coma state that I had the experience of entering a dark tunnel. As I saw a distant and diffuse light, I began to walk along the tunnel towards the light. As I saw that light, I felt euphoric and I try to reach it as quickly as possible. When I managed that, I saw a wall/barrier of a fluid light, intense and very bright. I felt a huge desire to cross that barrier of light. However, I have clear notion that I felt fear about not knowing what could be beyond that barrier. Such fear made me decide to return to the starting point in the tunnel, which was extremely hard to do, unlike the moment I try to reach the light barrier, whose approach was fast. As I reached the starting point in the tunnel I got out of the coma.",
